<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1477_5305.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser fründtlich nachpürlich willig dienst. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Und</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>waß wir ehren liebs unnd guots vermoegend,
<lb n="3"/>zuo vor. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsam</unclear> wiß in sonders
<lb n="4"/>guot fründ, unnd gethrüw lieb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuren</unclear>, uff den
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leidigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnfahl</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ully</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lindenners</unclear></persName>, so er an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">peter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oüchster</unclear></persName>, landts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fändrich</unclear> begangen, ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vf</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hüt</unclear> dato <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eimn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gietigen</unclear> tag an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesetzt</unclear>, in den
<lb n="8"/>sachen zehandlen, dero wegen zum <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lütern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bricht</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lüten</unclear> sin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bscheid</unclear> und antwurt. Zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kleren</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>wie er dan persoenlich er schinen sol. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">luthrung</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>an geding. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Einns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fryen</unclear> sichern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gleits</unclear> zuo der
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gütigenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tädig</unclear> und wider umb den in die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fryheit</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>Ime dz selbig zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüssen</unclear> damit also hiemit im
<lb n="14"/>rechten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mandt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kürtzt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uch</unclear> hiemit
<lb n="15"/>alle nach pürliche dienst zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewisen</unclear>, sind wir
<lb n="16"/>wol geneigt, und gotts des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allmechtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelhende</unclear>, dato den <origDate when="1605" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">17</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mey</unclear>, s
<lb n="18"/>anno 1605</origDate>
<lb n="19"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-565" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Landtamman</unclear> und rath, der
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vsseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roden</unclear>, zuo Appenzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1477_5306.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1477_5307.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1477_5308.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> frommen, fürsichtigen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrsammen</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wÿsen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermaister
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> Rath der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geliebten</unclear> fründen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachpuren</unclear>.
</p>
